# TableFlow global

- Work on **`main`**. No commit/push without user authorization. Keep WIP.
- Scope to one domain when possible. Read `docs/modules/<domain>.md` before editing.
- Never touch Sala Chocolatte DB. TableFlow remote schema/RPC/RLS/Edge only with explicit auth.
- No drive-by refactors, UI restyles, or public API changes unless requested.
- Supabase via feature services / `core/infrastructure` — never raw client from UI.
- After code changes: relevant Vitest specs, then `npm run lint` / `npm run build` when appropriate. E2E must not mutate remote data (`e2e/helpers/network-safety.ts`).
- Report risks, skipped tests, and what was *not* changed.
